        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-1" value="覆盖判定与输出" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="34" y="1630" width="489" height="347" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-2" value="直径与最小包围圆计算" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="227" y="1134" width="350" height="446" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-3" value="几何状态判定" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="799" width="448" height="286" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-4" value="候选交点收集" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="487" y="543" width="310" height="541" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-5" value="半平面生成" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="851" y="200" width="283" height="368" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-6" value="开始" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;arcSize=50;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="965" y="20" width="55" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-7" value="输入: 检测点 \(S_i=(x_i, y_i)\), 示向度 \(\theta_i (i=1,\dots,n)\), 误差半宽 \(\delta=1^\circ\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="863" y="104" width="260" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-8" value="1. 平移并尺度归一化检测点坐标&#xa;令半平面集合 \(H \leftarrow \emptyset\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="890" y="220" width="230" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-9" value="2. 循环: \(i = 1, \dots, n\) ?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="978" y="360" width="30" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-10" value="3. 计算 \(\alpha_i^- = \theta_i - \delta, \alpha_i^+ = \theta_i + \delta\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="963" y="463" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-11" value="4. 将两条方向边界转成两个线性半平面，加入 \(H\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="995" y="568" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-12" value="6. 令候选交点集 \(Q \leftarrow \emptyset\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="853" y="463" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-13" value="7. 循环: 每一对不同半平面边界 \((H_j, H_k)\) ?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="643" y="568" width="30" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-14" value="8. 两条边界不平行?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="633" y="696" width="30" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-15" value="9. 求交点 \(q\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="618" y="824" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-16" value="10. \(q\) 满足 \(H\) 中全部约束?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="665" y="927" width="30" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-17" value="11. \(Q \leftarrow Q \cup \{q\}\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="675" y="1029" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-18" value="15. 由 \(H\) 求一个可行点 \(G_0\) (若存在)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="523" y="696" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-19" value="16. \(G_0\) 是否存在?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="278" y="824" width="30" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-20" value="17. 返回 &#39;空集&#39;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="55" y="1029" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-21" value="19. \(rec(\Omega_B)\) 是否含非零方向?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="333" y="927" width="30" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-22" value="20. 返回 &#39;非空无界凸集&#39;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="165" y="1029" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-23" value="22. 对 \(Q\) 去重，并用 Andrew 单调链构造凸包 \(V=(V_1,\dots,V_m)\)&#xa;23. 按 \(affdim(\Omega_B)\) 标识 &#39;单点 / 线段 / 有界二维凸多边形&#39;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="373" y="1029" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-24" value="24. \(m = 1\) ?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="388" y="1159" width="30" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-25" value="25. \(D \leftarrow 0\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="263" y="1365" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-26" value="27. \(m = 2\) ?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="443" y="1262" width="30" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-27" value="28. \(D \leftarrow \|V_1 - V_2\|_2\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="373" y="1365" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-28" value="30. 用旋转卡壳推进对踵点，得到最远顶点对及直径 \(D\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="483" y="1365" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-29" value="33. 枚举全部两点直径圆与非共线三点外接圆&#xa;仅保留覆盖全部顶点的候选圆" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="373" y="1445" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-30" value="34. 取候选圆中半径最小者，得到 \((C^*, R_{min})\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="373" y="1525" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-31" value="35. \(|R_{min} - D/2| \le \epsilon_{metric}\) ?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="388" y="1655" width="30" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-32" value="36. 覆盖结论 \(\leftarrow\) &#39;存在直径为 \(D\) 的覆盖圆&#39;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="253" y="1758" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-33" value="38. 覆盖结论 \(\leftarrow\) &#39;直径为 \(D\) 的圆不能覆盖&#39;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="428" y="1758" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-34" value="40. 将 \(V, C^*, D, R_{min}\) 映射回原始米制坐标并返回" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="373" y="1838" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-35" value="结束" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;arcSize=50;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="262" y="1918" width="55" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
